               <msContents>
                  <summary>A Sanskrit verse recording the foundation of the cave-temple named Mahendraviṣṇugṛha by the
							Guṇabhara (Mahendravarman I Pallava) around 600/625 CE.</summary>
               </msContents>
               <physDesc>
                  <handDesc>
                     <p>The stone engraving of Grantha script is not yet fully mastered. This
								inscription was engraved by a beginner or was one of the early
								attempts to engrave Grantha script on stone.</p>
                  </handDesc>
               </physDesc>
            </msDesc>
