   <p>Edited and translated in <bibl><ptr target="bib:Hultzsch1896-1897_06"/></bibl>, with visual documentation (EI 4.19). Text and summary in <bibl><ptr target="bib:Mahalingam1988_01"/></bibl> (IP 24). Text and translation in <bibl><ptr target="bib:Filliozat1984_01"/><citedRange unit="page">104-105</citedRange></bibl>, in <bibl><ptr target="bib:Brocquet1997_01"/></bibl> (B 20). See <bibl><ptr target="bib:Francis2013_01"/></bibl> (IR 24).</p>
   
   <p>This revised edition Emmanuel Francis, based on autopsy and photos (2004).</p>
   
